1: Types of TypeCasting
- Widening Type Casting (Implicit or Automatic)
- Narrowing Type Casting (Explicit or Manual)
Widening Type Casting:
 byte -> short -> int -> long (will be done by compiler Automatically)
Narrowing Type Casting:
  long -> int -> short ->byte (will need to do by programmer)

